---
/**
 * Privacy policy.
 *
 * Written from what this site actually does, verified against the code rather
 * than adapted from another company's policy — the client asked for original
 * wording, and a borrowed policy describes a stack you do not run.
 *
 * Every claim below traces to something in this repository:
 *   forms          -> functions/api/estimate.ts
 *   file storage   -> the ESTIMATE_UPLOADS R2 binding in that function
 *   email delivery -> Resend, same file
 *   bot check      -> Cloudflare Turnstile, same file
 *   maps           -> the Google Maps iframe on / and /contact/
 *   reviews        -> functions/api/reviews.ts, server side, no visitor data
 *   storage        -> localStorage in PromoBar.astro and LeadPopup.astro
 *   analytics      -> none. There is no analytics script on this site.
 *
 * If any of those change, this page changes with them. It should also be read
 * by the company's attorney before launch; it is accurate, but accurate is not
 * the same as sufficient for every jurisdiction the company may later sell in.
 */
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { business, legalUpdated } from '../content/idf';
---

<Page
  title={`Privacy Policy — ${business.name}`}
  description={`How ${business.name} handles the information you send through this website.`}
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  standfirst={`What we collect, why, and what we do with it. Last updated ${legalUpdated}.`}
>
  <section class="hp-section hp-section--tight">
    <div class="legal">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {business.name} is a Virginia Class A general contractor based in Sterling,
        Virginia. Our licence number is {business.license}. If you have a question about
        anything on this page, write to <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a>
        or call <a href={business.phonePrimaryHref}>{business.phonePrimary}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect information in one way only: you type it into a form on this site
        and send it to us. We do not buy contact lists, and there is no analytics or
        advertising tracker on this website.
      </p>
      <p>The forms ask for some or all of the following, depending on which one you use:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name, phone number and email address</li>
        <li>The property address the work concerns</li>
        <li>What kind of work you want, your budget range and your timeframe</li>
        <li>Anything you write in the details box</li>
        <li>Photographs or PDFs you choose to attach</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Our server also records the IP address and browser user-agent the submission
        arrived from, alongside the submission itself. That is there so we can tell a
        real enquiry from an automated one.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not ask for, and you should not send us, your date of birth, social
        security number, bank or card details, or income and employment information.
        No form on this site collects any of those. If financing is discussed, that
        happens directly with the lender on their own secure system, not here.
      </p>

      <h2>What we do with it</h2>
      <p>
        We use it to answer you and to price and carry out your work. That is the whole
        purpose. We do not sell it, rent it, or share it for anyone else's marketing.
      </p>
      <p>When you send a form, two things happen:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          The submission and any files you attached are written to encrypted object
          storage on Cloudflare's network, so an enquiry cannot be lost to a failed email.
        </li>
        <li>
          A notification is emailed to our own staff addresses through Resend, our email
          delivery provider.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We share information with other people only where the work requires it — for
        example, giving a subcontractor the site address so they can attend — or where
        the law requires it of us.
      </p>

      <h2>Other companies involved in running this site</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts this website and stores form submissions.
          As the host, it processes the network requests your browser makes, which
          includes your IP address.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong> checks that a form was sent by a person
          rather than a script. It runs in your browser when you use a form.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Resend</strong> delivers the notification emails to us.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Maps</strong> is embedded on our home and contact pages so you
          can find the showroom. Loading that map is a request to Google, and Google
          receives it under its own privacy policy. Nothing you type into our forms is
          sent to Google.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Reviews</strong> shown on this site are fetched by our server
          from Google, not by your browser. No information about you is involved.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies and browser storage</h2>
      <p>
        We do not set advertising or analytics cookies, because we do not run
        advertising or analytics on this site.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do use your browser's local storage for two small conveniences: remembering
        that you closed the offer bar at the top of the page, and remembering that you
        closed the offer pop-up. Both are a single yes/no value stored in your own
        browser. They are never sent to us and never leave your device. Clearing your
        browsing data removes them.
      </p>
      <p>
        Cloudflare and Google may set their own cookies as part of the security check
        and the embedded map. Those are theirs, governed by their policies, not ours.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiries that become jobs are kept as part of the project record, because we
        need them for warranty, tax and licensing purposes. Enquiries that do not become
        jobs are kept while there is a reasonable prospect of the conversation resuming,
        and are removed after that.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        Write to <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a> and ask us to
        send you a copy of what we hold about you, correct something that is wrong, or
        delete it. We will do it. If we are required to keep something — a completed
        contract, for instance — we will tell you what and why.
      </p>
      <p>
        We only email you about your own enquiry or your own job. If we ever start
        sending anything else, every message will carry an unsubscribe link.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        This site is for people arranging construction work on a property. It is not
        directed at children and we do not knowingly collect information from them.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If we change how any of this works, we change this page and update the date at
        the top of it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
